@startuml
[*] --> StartTriage : Begin Triage
StartTriage --> CheckAirway : Check Airway
CheckAirway --> AirwayBlocked : Airway Blocked?
AirwayBlocked --> AirwayEmergency : Yes
AirwayBlocked --> CheckBreathing : No
AirwayEmergency --> [*] : Immediate Action

CheckBreathing --> BreathingOK : Breathing OK?
BreathingOK --> CheckCirculation : Yes
CheckCirculation --> CirculationProblem : Circulation Problem?
CirculationProblem --> CirculationEmergency : Yes
CirculationEmergency --> [*] : Immediate Action
CirculationProblem --> CheckDisability : No

BreathingOK --> CheckDisability : No
CheckDisability --> MentalAlertness : Mental Alertness?
MentalAlertness --> DisabilityEmergency : Problems Detected
DisabilityEmergency --> [*] : Immediate Action
MentalAlertness --> CheckExposure : No

CheckExposure --> ExposureRisk : Exposure Risk?
ExposureRisk --> ExposureEmergency : Yes
ExposureEmergency --> [*] : Immediate Action
ExposureRisk --> FinalizeTriage : No

FinalizeTriage --> AssignPriority : Assign Clinical Priority
AssignPriority --> [*] : Triage Complete
@enduml